; Alert 1 stands in for any alert missing from this file; ^N is its number.
1 note alert
Lisa Share could not find the message that should appear here.  If you are
unable to proceed, mention the number ^N to the person who gave you Lisa Share.

; Alert 2 is shown if the tool cannot go on.
2 stop alert
Lisa Share is having technical difficulties and must stop.  Your other
documents are not affected.

